{
  "id": 8867157704903,
  "title": "Christmas Bedding Quilt – Soft Microfiber Holiday Bedspread",
  "handle": "christmas-bedding-quilt-soft-microfiber-holiday-bedspread",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the festive spirit with the Jeminise Christmas Quilt Set, designed to bring warmth and holiday cheer to your home. Crafted from premium microfiber, this lightweight yet cozy quilt offers exceptional softness and comfort for year-round enjoyment, making it a perfect addition to your seasonal decor or a thoughtful gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Festive Holiday Design:</strong> Adorned with bright, high-quality Christmas prints to create a warm and joyful atmosphere in any room.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Premium Comfort:</strong> Made from soft, lightweight microfiber for ultimate comfort, keeping you warm in winter and cool in warmer months.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Sizing:</strong> Available in Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various beds and living spaces.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift:</strong> An ideal Christmas present for family, friends, or loved ones for holidays, birthdays, or special celebrations.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable with cold water on a gentle cycle, and tumble dry low or air dry for lasting softness and convenience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes as a complete Quilt set, ready to enhance your bedding collection.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Sets</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Microfiber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Christmas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60\"x70\"), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), King (102\"x91\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable with cold water on gentle cycle. Tumble dry low or air dry.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
